Common StudentCharacteristic
    documentation "Reflects important characteristics of a student. If a student has a characteristic present, that characteristic is considered true or active for that student. If a characteristic is not present, no assumption is made as to the applicability of the characteristic, but local policy may dictate otherwise."
    descriptor StudentCharacteristic
        documentation "The characteristic designated for the student."
        is part of identity
    common Period
        documentation "The time periods for which characteristic was effective."
        is optional collection
    shared string DesignatedBy
        documentation "The person, organization, or department that designated the characteristic."
        is optional
